      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777639127920,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1.Docker , and dockerizing of api/application\n2.a bit of docker networking \n3.creating a paytm backend \n4.ts \n5.postgres and prisma \n6.serverless and hono/cloudflare worker\n7.aws deployment",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1.Docker , and dockerizing of api/application\n2.a bit of docker networking \n3.creating a paytm backend \n4.ts \n5.postgres and prisma \n6.serverless and hono/cloudflare worker\n7.aws deployment",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "tO_NWjRIVOr-VgVSaZtUn",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 565.6590437114216,
      "y": 473.86603643591786,
      "width": 847,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "a2",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 395107451,
      "version": 295,
      "versionNonce": 1846622427,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1777639674866,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Docker :\n1.Why do we need to learn docker ?\n    ->It helps you understand opens source project cause a lot of open source\n    project use docker to either containerize there api /app or database \n    two opensource project example are :",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Docker :\n1.Why do we need to learn docker ?\n    ->It helps you understand opens source project cause a lot of open source\n    project use docker to either containerize there api /app or database \n    two opensource project example are :",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "VPqTIqHzeiY0E1sAGF2ku",
      "type": "image",
      "x": 641.5457634742808,
