      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Downloading mongodb in our image cause \napi depends on it , in real world \napplication its not good to have one container \nwith multiple service to avoid it we use docker-compose\nfile to orchestrate multiple container service \nbut for simplicity lets download in one image",
